Got it — you want a **clean ASCII-only script** with **no Unicode symbols** (no ✔ ✖ ! arrows etc.).  

Below is a **fully cleaned version** of the HTML dashboard script:

- **No Unicode glyphs**  
- **No smart quotes**  
- Only ASCII characters  
- Works on all PowerShell versions  
- Renders clean traffic-light statuses using **CSS colors only**, not Unicode icons

